       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. HELLOW1.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77 FNAME    PIC X(5).
       77 MNAME    PIC X(5).
       77 LNAME    PIC X(5).
       77 FULLNAME PIC X(15).
       77 SEN1     PIC X(20) VALUE 'ALL IS WELL'.
       77 WORD1    PIC X(5).
       77 WORD2    PIC X(5).
       77 WORD3    PIC X(5).
       01 WS-STRING-1 PIC X(40) VALUE 'GODS OWN COUNTRY'.
       01 WS-COUNT    PIC 9(2).
       01 WS-STRING-2 PIC X(40) VALUE 'GODS.OWN.COUNTRY'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0100-MAIN-PARA.
           ACCEPT FNAME.
           ACCEPT MNAME.
           ACCEPT LNAME.
           STRING FNAME DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  MNAME DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  LNAME DELIMITED BY SIZE
             INTO FULLNAME.
           DISPLAY FULLNAME.
           UNSTRING SEN1 DELIMITED BY SPACE
             INTO WORD1
                  WORD2
                  WORD3
           END-UNSTRING
           DISPLAY WORD1.
           DISPLAY WORD2.
           DISPLAY WORD3.
           INSPECT WS-STRING-1 TALLYING WS-COUNT FOR ALL 'O'.
           DISPLAY 'NUMBER OF O = ' WS-COUNT.
           INSPECT WS-STRING-2 REPLACING ALL '.' BY ' '.
           DISPLAY 'REPLACED: '     WS-STRING-2.
           STOP RUN.
 